THOUGHT: Now let's create a child template that extends the base template:

```bash
cat <<'EOF' > views/child.tpl
{% extends "base.tpl" %}
{% block title %}Child Title{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<h1>Hello {{ var }}</h1>
{% endblock %}
EOF
```

